{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25871","headline":"奉酬乐天立秋夕有怀见寄 · 李绅","name":"奉酬乐天立秋夕有怀见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深夜星汉静，秋风初报凉。\n阶篁淅沥响，露叶参差光。\n冰兔半升魄，铜壶微滴长。\n薄帷乍飘卷，襟带轻摇扬。\n此际昏梦清，斜月满轩房。\n屣履步前楹，劒戟森在行。\n重城宵正分，号鼓互相望。\n独坐有所思，夫君鸾凤章。\n天津落星河，一苇安可航。\n龙泉白玉首，鱼服黄金装。\n报国未知効，惟鹈徒在梁。\n裴回顾戎旃，颢气生东方。\n衰叶满栏草，斑毛盈镜霜。\n羸牛未脱辕，老马强腾骧。\n吟君白雪唱，慙媿巴人肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25871.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25871","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}